{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"practice-5-3-application-writing","kind":"practice","title":"应用文写作专项训练","year":"2025","region":"全国","variant":"专项","instructions":[],"sections":[{"id":"section-practice","title":"应用文写作专项训练","instructions":[],"layout":"flow","groups":[{"id":"group-writing","instructions":[],"stimulusBlocks":[],"sharedOptions":[],"questions":[{"id":"q-1","displayNumber":1,"sourceQuestionNumber":1,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 1"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假定你是某国际学校向日葵美术社(Sunflower Art Society)的成员,请你用英文为美术社的网站写一则纳新启事。内容包括:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.成员要求;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.社团宗旨;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.主要活动。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Notice"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.注意本文是招募通知,因此语言要简洁清楚。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.注意三个要点要齐全。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.时态以一般现在时为主。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Notice"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The Sunflower Art Society is a friendly organization which welcomes students of all levels of art experience. It aims to promote students􀆳 interest in art and give them professional help in painting, design, photography, etc. Joining the Sunflower Art Society will give you experience working as an artist, opportunities to meet famous artists, and a chance to have your work shown in the school gallery. What are you waiting for? Click on the link below and sign up."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"b76470f7319b4fc5d6b6f791437e95653456a784399efb8f40b6dbd36d7036ff","answerVariantFingerprint":"dcc469f81c275299f0d379c75a42c03b6a4ccfb698b6be8ffdfdd7f313ea6b25"}},{"id":"q-2","displayNumber":2,"sourceQuestionNumber":2,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 2"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假定你是李华,你的外籍朋友Mr Brown 对中国文化很感兴趣,请给他写一封邮件,邀请他来参加非物质文化遗产(intangible cultural heritage)展览活动。内容包括:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.写信目的;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.活动时间、地点;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.活动内容。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数 80 左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.注意文章的要点:写信目的;活动时间、地点;活动内容。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.时态主要应用一般现在时和一般将来时。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.注意使用恰当的连接词衔接句子。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Mr Brown,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Knowing that you are interested in Chinese culture, I􀆳m writing to invite you to have a look at the intangible cultural heritage show."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"91a75e919a64e38de023fd04dc1788e0a8609df893233af248e4ce777f11cd37","answerVariantFingerprint":"155f709c31acd090231daa144d9737e547bf433e6c702663020ee360a2439171"}},{"id":"q-3","displayNumber":3,"sourceQuestionNumber":3,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 3"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"你的英国朋友Tom将来你家共度除夕,你打算当天下午去地铁站接他。请你用英文写一封电子邮件,告知他相关信息:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.你们全家都欢迎他;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.接他的地点和时间:地铁五号线西兴站B出口,1月27日下午4点;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.晚上的主要安排:看春晚、包饺子、放鞭炮。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.开头和结尾已给出,不计入总词数。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Tom,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Yours,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Li Hua"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.写作要求的要点比较多,注意要点不可遗漏。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.注意各个要点之间的顺畅连接。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Tom, "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"How is it going?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The Chinese New Year is coming and I am very glad that you will come to spend New Year􀆳s Eve with us. My family and I are really looking forward to welcoming you to our home for the event. I will meet you at the B Exit of the Xixing subway station, which is on Line 5,at 4 pm on the 27th, January. In the evening we will watch the CCTV New Year􀆳s Gala, make dumplings together and also set off some firecrackers!"}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"af7520259d483c7842dcd55acf7f538b16d256d77fb80c48e7cabf9b815720cf","answerVariantFingerprint":"1ac1b8019f60ee34b9122b1f1482389cfeaa872a270b1459bd1abe01f774b0ed"}},{"id":"q-4","displayNumber":4,"sourceQuestionNumber":4,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 4"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假定你是李华,将在校报上推荐一部英语经典作品。请你给美国朋友Tom写一封电子邮件,征求其意见,内容包括:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.询问近况;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.征求意见;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.表示期待。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.本文是咨询信。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.写作时除了列出的三点,还要将背景信息给出。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.时态以一般现在时为主。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Tom,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Time flies! It􀆳s been half a year since you returned to America. How is everything going on with your life and study now?"}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"53b03d962aa47ccb50aa362fa95b285bf1378d374f37d59ef5f9a71405fe8457","answerVariantFingerprint":"0c638cdc134ca9f6e5514ee1bf33957f9ffec5edc0f8481143655ddd36d07f21"}},{"id":"q-5","displayNumber":5,"sourceQuestionNumber":5,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 5"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假如你是李华,世界自然基金会(WWF)是世界上最大的从事自然和野生动物保护的国际组织。请你给它发一封邮件,指出野生动物面临的危机并提出建议。内容如下:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.野生动物被猎杀的现状;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.猎杀野生动物的后果;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.自己的建议。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.本文是建议信。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.注意三个要点不可遗漏。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.时态应以一般现在时和现在进行时为主。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Sir or Madam,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Learning that many wild animals are being killed and become extinct due to merciless human activities, I􀆳m writing to express great concern and offer you some suggestions."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"a8754dc03de3e57c037e32d6bcec3fde45dfc77f9a97d639bcebbb135d9aa954","answerVariantFingerprint":"da9c0757ec8312376e43e22c225bb53a783c933721d58c2a1717f59ea1bd8882"}},{"id":"q-6","displayNumber":6,"sourceQuestionNumber":6,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 6"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假设你是李华,你的英国朋友Emily来信说她非常喜欢中国的民族舞,并打算最近来中国学习民族舞,想请你帮她推荐一位舞蹈老师。请你根据以下要点给她写一封信,推荐一位老师。要点:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.介绍你所推荐的老师;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.推荐该老师的原因;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.祝愿她拜师成功。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.开头和结尾已给出,不计入总词数。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Emily,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Yours,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Li Hua"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.要点:介绍你所推荐的老师;推荐该老师的原因;祝愿她拜师成功。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.人称主要为第一人称和第三人称。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.时态以一般现在时为主,兼用现在完成时。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Emily, "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Glad to hear that you are going to learn Chinese folk dance in China, and I􀆳m more than happy to recommend an excellent teacher Miss Chen to you."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"039a319ab6bfa315bdda9f37df7a719ddf4d6a5be2d8b2d24f993ac21cac6907","answerVariantFingerprint":"4e53a00d91c872f59eeecf22c437597ce0615f186798de08dca1c65109c99d60"}},{"id":"q-7","displayNumber":7,"sourceQuestionNumber":7,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 7"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假定你是Tom,请你为校报的“读者专栏”写一封回信。来信内容如下:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Editor,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"I can􀆳t stop myself from using my mobile phone. I enjoy staying up late watching movies to relieve my pressure. In fact, this problem is affecting my studies. What can I do?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dale"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"写作时要注意回信包括以下要点:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.对Dale的烦恼表示理解。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.提出合理的建议。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.适当地表达祝愿。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"4.回信的时态以一般现在时为主。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"1a416e310046b3baf000c78710bb5813c209baf8766eb414583a3a798147163c","answerVariantFingerprint":"8000c05eb16864b042a520a0c161468554e6408546324d829ed01acb595683a6"}},{"id":"q-8","displayNumber":8,"sourceQuestionNumber":8,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 8"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假定你是李华,打算今年暑假去美国旅游。请你给Travel America国际旅行社写一封电子邮件进行咨询,内容如下:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.请其推荐合适的旅游路线;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.请其告知相关的旅游费用。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.开头和结尾已给出,不计入总词数。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Sir/Madam,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Yours,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Li Hua"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.本文是一封咨询邮件,注意用词礼貌,表达清楚。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.本文的主体时态应该是一般现在时。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Sir/Madam, "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"I􀆳m planning to travel to the USA in the coming July. Therefore, I􀆳m writing to inquire about travel routes of your agency."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"I intend to stay in America for about 10 days, during which I hope to have a look at some unique natural scenery and have a taste of local customs. So, could you please recommend some suitable travel routes? In addition, I􀆳d like to know the prices of the routes, covering all the traveling expenses."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"720f1254e2e04df7f86c6a6e926dfdd90c3d280d7b9d359ff9