"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"860ca8ef2870a5a3258eff62ecf8452fd785053b05b15bf371f844d99da793bf","answerVariantFingerprint":"52706af12985d5ac373d1e0cdfefa72eb161b046137ae88e737a5f41a911fb04"}},{"id":"q-12","displayNumber":12,"sourceQuestionNumber":12,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 12 "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假定你是李华,Wilson High School学生代表团将于5月8号来你校进行文化交流访问活动,请你代表学校用英语给负责人Christina写一封邮件。主要内容包括:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.表示欢迎;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.活动内容;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.征求意见。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.本文是欢迎辞,注意词汇的礼貌、热情。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.注意要点的覆盖,三个要点不可遗漏。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.主体时态用一般将来时为宜。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Christina,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"I􀆳m writing on behalf of my school to extend our warmest welcome and keep you informed of the arrangements."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"2e945b127bacec1f4c1b28b861fb2791297c4f6b83a7a5032599d019d06415ab","answerVariantFingerprint":"fcdff76f8ab0d793844b55347ee6981b4e725a501645c652b942df93bc7d228b"}},{"id":"q-13","displayNumber":13,"sourceQuestionNumber":13,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 13 "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假如你是李华。期中考试后,为了让大家好好放松一下,上周末你班组织了一次郊游活动。这次活动受到了全班同学的一致好评。请你就本次活动给校园英语报写一篇报道。内容包括:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.欣赏风景;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.享受野餐;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.做小游戏。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:1.词数80左右,题目已为你写好;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"A Pleasant Outing"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.本文是一篇报道,讲述过去的事情,因此要用过去时。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.记述郊游活动,要注意使用轻松快乐的词汇。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.注意句子之间的合理连接。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"A Pleasant Outing"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Last weekend, in order to help us students get relaxed after the midterm examination, our class organized an outing and everyone took an active part in it. On the way, we saw amazing scenes and took many photos. Once we reached the chosen site, we enjoyed a delicious picnic first and then played interesting games. Everybody had lots of fun."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"eeb5170255a71635a04c61529ab1cc0bf41c2741a654ec87991abde53ec1e47d","answerVariantFingerprint":"53ce118a367eba9005f8c35e4372971a6501e0b082f081e2dde9f66a64cb6bde"}},{"id":"q-14","displayNumber":14,"sourceQuestionNumber":14,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 14 "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"第二届“一带一路”国际合作高峰论坛将于2019年在中国举办,组委会正在向社会招募志愿者。假设你是李华,请你给该组织的负责人Jack写一封申请信,要点包括:1.参加意图;2.自我优势;3.希望获批。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:1.词数80左右;2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"参考词汇:第二届“一带一路”国际合作高峰论坛the Second Belt and Road Forum for International Cooperation"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.本文是申请信,注意写作时要明确申请的目的,并介绍自己的优势。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.特别注意列举自己的优势时要条理清楚,具有说服力。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.列举自己的优势和特点要用一般现在时。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Jack,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"I􀆳m Li Hua, a middle school student from China. Hearing that you are seeking volunteers for the Second Belt and Road Forum for International Cooperation, I􀆳d like to seize this opportunity. By participating in this activity, I believe I can spare no effort to help the people present."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"17756e05bf2cffe1216db1071ac37f158ac05771a2cae914d06946c74baad8e6","answerVariantFingerprint":"3408b30770a264b93bc4e7f4e3fe5d3a37c18226dfe673eac66d90cffbd12e54"}},{"id":"q-15","displayNumber":15,"sourceQuestionNumber":15,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 15 "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假如你是高中生李华,你的美国笔友Jack热爱中国传统文化,最近打算来中国工作生活一段时间,但是不确定应该去往哪个城市,写信向你咨询。请你给他写一封回信,内容包括:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.你推荐的城市;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.推荐的理由(不少于两条);"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.美好祝愿。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可以适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.本文是推荐信,注意推荐的信息要明确,理由要充分。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.时态以一般现在时为主。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Jack,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"I am so pleased to learn that you are to spend some time in China."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"I recommend you stay in Beijing, the capital and cultural center of China. The city enjoys a high reputation for its abundance of ancient architecture, which represents the traditional local lifestyles. And there are also plenty of museums where precious relics of historical interest are waiting for you to explore. Besides, the exceptional Peking Opera performances there are also what you can􀆳t miss."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"9c708243f9266ed67f710633ddbe9f826c964f9ec1e17276e19479052c65ba25","answerVariantFingerprint":"aed275efa5c817b5d5207bed3da224d000ff6450b6e9bf5d54f54ad50b8d76c7"}},{"id":"q-16","displayNumber":16,"sourceQuestionNumber":16,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 16 "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"随着环保理念深入人心, 如何保护水资源越来越引起社会的重视。浙江虽然是水资源大省,对水资源的保护也刻不容缓。假如你是李华,请代表学生会向全校发起倡议,珍惜水资源,节约用水。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"内容提示:1.珍惜水资源的重要性;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.如何从身边小事做起。 "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可以适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.本文是倡议信,因此注意时态为一般时或将来时。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.注意列举的要点和背景介绍中暗含的要点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.注意句式的多样化。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"My dear fellow students,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"As the concept of environmental protection draws increasing concern, water conservation, which is vital for the survival of humans as well as other species, has engaged growing public attention."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"cd574704e1426f7ab66dd70fd1d45a1f777976d5e9194e7792411246408eb2c9","answerVariantFingerprint":"34ad7805f0def2686b77d67716bc8b361f232fa4e9edafe6d2135db716292c99"}},{"id":"q-17","displayNumber":17,"sourceQuestionNumber":17,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 17 "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假定你是校英语俱乐部负责人李华,你校即将举行“英语角”活动,你想请你的朋友——某国际高中学生会主席Jack帮忙选派5名学生参加活动。请给Jack写一封电子邮件, 内容包括:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.活动时间;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.活动主题;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.希望选派什么样的学生。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.要点齐全:注意三个要点不能遗漏。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.句式多样化:句子中最好能出现非谓语动词、从句等高级语言结构。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.连接顺畅:要点句子之间的连接要合理顺畅。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Jack,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The English Corner of our school is scheduled for January 4th. To make it more attractive, I􀆳m writing to ask you if you could arrange for five students of your school to join us. As the topic will be “Difference between Chinese and American Education”, it will be great if the five students are familiar with the American education system. I􀆳m absolutely sure that your support will add much color to the event and guarantee its success."}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","relativePath":"新高考版高考总复习英语5·3A版/专题二十一应用文写作/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包/专题资料包.docx","sha256":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e7decbf7493ba5a5841b936e4e5878d46acfc24450b35","locator":{},"extractionMethod":"docx-xml","confidence":0.96}],"reviewStatus":"approved","dedupeSignature":{"questionContentFingerprint":"7e7cfab00850bff90d2ce547c2798a87058be936b71911a42c08ebbc716904ad","answerVariantFingerprint":"e826a524a9775a7bb68a8a04119c58eef049238830d42870c8e87935736c4413"}},{"id":"q-18","displayNumber":18,"sourceQuestionNumber":18,"type":"essay","promptBlocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 18 "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"假如你是李华,共享单车逐渐进入海外市场,你的英国笔友Tom对此非常感兴趣。请你写封邮件向他介绍共享单车。邮件的内容必须包括以下几点:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.共享单车的使用方法(扫二维码,解锁骑车);"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.共享单车的便利之处;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.询问共享单车在英国的使用情况。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"注意:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.词数80左右;"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.可以适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"参考词汇:共享单车a shared bike;二维码a QR code。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Tom,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Yours sincerely,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Li Hua"}]}],"placement":{"kind":"standalone"},"options":[],"blanks":[],"answerSpec":{"availability":"answered","gradingMode":"manual","kind":"reference","referenceAnswer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"[写作提示]　"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"1.注意文章的三个要点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"2.文章主要介绍现在的情况,因此主要时态是一般现在时或现在完成时。慎用过去时。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"3.注意三个要点信息之间的顺畅连接。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"One possible version:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Dear Tom, "}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"I am more than delighted to know you are greatly interested in shared bikes. It is my pleasure to introduce them to you. When you spot a shared bike, what you need to do is just scan the QR code to unlock it and enjoy your trip. Not only are shared bikes environmentally friendly and convenient, but also they charge low prices and can be parked almost everywhere, which have given them advantages over other means of public transport.With Mobike entering the UK, I can􀆳t help but wonder about its situation there. Could you please tell me something about that?"}]}]},"explanationBlocks":[],"sourceRefs":[{"sourceDocumentId":"0f528d92b8bc04da8a1e